-- title:
--   Filtered Brownian property of the queue limit noise
-- statement:
--   In any coupled joint queue subsequence limit, the standardized limit noise is Brownian with independent increments relative to a filtration containing the limiting past observations. In particular the limiting queue state is adapted to that filtration.
-- source:
--   Atar, Mandelbaum, and Reiman, Scheduling a multi class queue with many exponential servers, https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0407058

